                                          printing. After connecting the pr=
inter to your Mac,=0A                                                    in=
stall the Mac software that came with the printer and=0A                   =
                                 use the printer=E2=80=99s setup assistant =
to connect the printer=0A                                                  =
  to your Wi-Fi network. After setting up, you can=0A                      =
                              disconnect the cable from your printer and Ma=
c and the=0A                                                    printer sho=
uld remain connected to the Wi-Fi network.=0A                              =
                  &lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                               =
 &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    3. Add the =
printer to your list of available printers:=0A                             =
